<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-12T18:04:58.975Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:04:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent cross-border fighting saw Pakistani security forces repel an infiltration, killing one Pakistani soldier and twelve militants, including Afghan Taliban fighters, while Pakistan warned the Taliban to stop using Afghan soil for attacks. A Houthi missile strike on Riyadh airport killed a Pakistani national and wounded eleven others, prompting regional condemnation. The Taliban are now leveraging European anti-migrant sentiment, and Afghanistan announced a potential China trade route to the Persian Gulf. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPMF95Nm5HV1pQeTVrX1hkaU52bkVfQUNCcjlMMVVUazlFalZpd3dnTVdvOTAxMWdZMk1wU1hfNHkyYXBVY2ZnbnVUa0N2Nm9uOTVTYVQzeGphOExkTWtoRElvUzBqMS1PWkpOQ1VpZy1VN0tUQ2hmYzV5WG1uRVFBb00yb3RjZDZ6andza0lBak9HVXl2QVFZeWk4NXVpc0d4OTVnX2FSY203allXNVlLa1lENGI1bnFLWG1IQVZlS0NyYjZWTUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Toronto Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPQ3V5YnRzeHd2dTVqV2U0SkdsQWNkdWNIWkwzcVZLZF9jQTNNaDVpYmkxTGFPNEJtMVVuSFQ2WjlfSi1PeEtEMThjcGlTX3phSjR2dGw0UjVWTzE1MjlobzRUaGRGbTd0WDZtVzJ6M2liekhJNWdlY1NsMmxfVlhKYVFOXzVqTkRsSXFBX1pSQThWTEdwUWhWWmlYeUFpeU9zbUtaTVVLZEZuRzUt?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Herald&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://